{3053}{In place of a heart, you carry a tumor of rotten principles.}
{3054}{There's nothing wrong with you that reincarnation won't fix.}
{3055}{Is your job devoted to spreading ignorance?}
{3056}{You have a soft heart . . . and a head to match.}

// wizard
{3100}{Magick must addle the brain, because you are quite the dimwit.}
